Here is a list of vanilla WoW locations for every letter of the alphabet.

**A** — Azeroth
**B** — Blackrock Depths
**C** — Coldarra
**D** — Darkshore
**E** — Elwynn Forest
**F** — Feralas
**G** — Gnomeregan
**H** — Howling Fjord
**I** — Ironforge
**J** — Jorundall
**K** — Karazhan
**L** — Loch Modan
**M** — Moonglade
**N** — Northrend
**O** — Orgrimmar
**P** — The Postern
**Q** — Quel'Danas
**R** — Ratchet
**S** — Stormwind
**T** — Thunder Bluff
**U** — Undercity
**V** — Vashj'ir
**W** — Winterspring
**X** — Xal'atath
**Y** — Yojamba Isle
**Z** — Zoram Strand [end of text]


